{
	"nodes":[
		{"id":"ingress","type":"text","text":"## 🌐 1. Ingress & Wire Normalization\n- **RequestParser**: RFC 7230 parser (Headers, JSON, XML, Form)\n- **ContextDetector**: AST context inference\n- **BaselineProfiling**: $\\mu, \\sigma$ latency characterization","x":-600,"y":-200,"width":360,"height":220,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"oracles","type":"text","text":"## 🎯 2. Multi-Oracle Discovery\n- **Error Oracle**: Cast exceptions (Postgres/MSSQL/MySQL/Oracle)\n- **Boolean Invariant**: Deterministic TRUE vs FALSE diffs\n- **UNION Canary**: Nonce reflection at column index\n- **SPRT Timing**: Wald sequential probability ratio ($T = \\mu + 3\\sigma$)\n- **OAST Oracle**: Asynchronous out-of-band DNS/HTTP","x":-150,"y":-200,"width":420,"height":260,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"causal","type":"text","text":"## ⚖️ 3. Causal Verification Stage\n- **Step 1 ($s_0$)**: Baseline stability verification\n- **Step 2 ($s_1$)**: Positive intervention (TRUE condition)\n- **Step 3 ($s_2$)**: Counterfactual control (FALSE condition)\n- **Step 4 ($s_3$)**: Alternative hypothesis rejection\n- **Step 5 ($s_4$)**: 3x Clean-room isolated reproduction","x":350,"y":-200,"width":400,"height":250,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"graybox","type":"text","text":"## 🔬 4. Gray-Box Hybrid Subsystem\n- **IastRuntimeSensor**: In-process driver hooks (Zero egress required)\n- **HeadlessDomBridge**: Pre-encryption DOM injection (Bypasses WebCrypto/HMAC)\n- **MacroStateReplay**: 2FA/OTP solver & stateful transaction chaining\n- **WafBypassOrchestrator**: Authorized clearance cookies & test tokens","x":-150,"y":140,"width":420,"height":240,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"synthesis","type":"text","text":"## 📊 5. Synthesis & Telemetry\n- **Vectorized Extraction**: High-throughput bisection / UNION dump\n- **Adaptive Schema**: Data dictionary enumeration\n- **Evidence Synthesis**: 17-layer coverage matrix\n- **SARIF Exporter**: OASIS SARIF v2.1.0 telemetry export","x":350,"y":140,"width":400,"height":240,"color":"5"}
	],
